
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>My Portfolio</title>

<style>
* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

body {
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    background: #0d1020;
    color: white;
    line-height: 1.6;
}

header {
    background: rgba(20, 20, 45, 0.95);
    padding: 20px 8%;
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 100;
}

nav {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
}

.logo {
    font-size: 25px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #ff70b7;
}

nav ul {
    display: flex;
    list-style: none;
    gap: 25px;
}

nav ul a {
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: .3s;
}

nav ul a:hover {
    color: #ff70b7;
}

.menu {
    display: none;
    background: none;
    border: 1px solid white;
    color: white;
    padding: 7px 12px;
    cursor: pointer;
}

section {
    padding: 80px 10%;
}

.hero {
    min-height: 85vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 40px;
}

.hero h1 {
    font-size: 48px;
    margin: 15px 0;
}

.hero h1 span {
    color: #ff70b7;
}

.hero p, .about p, .project p {
    color: #b8bed3;
}

.btn {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 25px;
    padding: 12px 25px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff70b7, #9c83ff);
    color: #111;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-decoration: none;
}

.profile {
    width: 230px;
    height: 230px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff70b7, #9c83ff);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 65px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #17152c;
    flex-shrink: 0;
}

h2 {
    font-size: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
    color: #ff70b7;
}

.about {
    background: #151a30;
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 35px;
}

.skills-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
}

.skill, .project {
    background: #191e38;
    border: 1px solid #34334f;
    padding: 25px;
    border-radius: 15px;
    text-align: center;
    transition: .3s;
}

.skill:hover, .project:hover {
    transform: translateY(-7px);
    border-color: #ff70b7;
}

.projects-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 25px;
}

.project {
    text-align: left;
}

.project h3 {
    color: #c6a5ff;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.project a {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 15px;
    color: #ff70b7;
    text-decoration: none;
}

.education-card {
    background: #191e38;
    padding: 25px;
    border-left: 4px solid #ff70b7;
    border-radius: 10px;
}

.education-card p {
    color: #b8bed3;
}

.contact {
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, #302047, #25264c);
    border-radius: 20px;
    text-align: center;
}

.contact a {
    color: white;
    margin: 12px;
    display: inline-block;
    text-decoration: none;
}

footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 25px;
    color: #aaa;
    border-top: 1px solid #34334f;
}

@media(max-width: 768px) {
    .menu {
        display: block;
    }

    nav ul {
        display: none;
        flex-direction: column;
        position: absolute;
        top: 70px;
        left: 0;
        width: 100%;
        background: #191e38;
        padding: 20px;
    }

    nav ul.show {
        display: flex;
    }

    .hero {
        flex-direction: column;
        text-align: center;
    }

    .hero h1 {
        font-size: 35px;
    }

    .skills-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .projects-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
<nav>
    <div class="logo">MY PORTFOLIO</div>

    <button class="menu" id="menuBtn">☰</button>

    <ul id="navLinks">
        <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
        <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
        <li><a href="#skills">Skills</a></li>
        <li><a href="#projects">Projects</a></li>
        <li><a href="#education">Education</a></li>
        <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
    </ul>
</nav>
</header>

<!-- HOME -->
<section class="hero" id="home">

    <div>
        <p>HELLO! WELCOME TO MY PORTFOLIO</p>

        <h1>I'm <span>Your Name</span></h1>

        <h3>Data Science Student</h3>

        <p>
            I am passionate about technology,
            programming, data science and
            creating innovative solutions.
        </p>

        <a href="#projects" class="btn">Explore My Work</a>
    </div>

    <div class="profile">YN</div>

</section>

